{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I was sorting through my old game discs. Among them, there were many games I played when I was a kid. All of them were labeled...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All of them except <strong>one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It immediately caught my attention, and I decided to try playing it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What bad could it possibly do?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There were game files on it. Nothing unusual, except for the strange name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I launched it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What is this? A children\u2019s game?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>It's so cute and colorful, but why do I have a feeling like something\u2019s <strong>wrong..?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578040/extras/PicknikA.png?t=1742731315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>This ominous eclipse\u2026</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578040/extras/moonstartgo.png?t=1742731315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...Hey!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>My name is Sunshine!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Yes, yes, it's me! Will you help me?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>What are you waiting for?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>I'm waiting for you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578040/extras/IMG_75342.png?t=1742731315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 